# Product-specific environment variables.
#
# This file is owned by the product, not the template — the template never
# modifies it. Use it for env vars introduced by your product-specific
# modules (backend/app/modules/<your-module>/), as opposed to template-core
# vars, which belong in backend/.env.example.
#
# Copy to .env.product and fill in values; do not commit the real file.
